{"product_id":"buture-beta09-car-jump-starter","title":"【Flash Sale】Buture Beta09 Car Jump Starter 8000A with 160 PSI Air Compressor丨16-in-1 Roadside Kit","description":"\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj21q6sficlpq3aamc\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Buture Beta09 8000A Car Jump Starter with 160PSI Air Compressor 丨Your Ultimate Roadside Emergency Power Pack\"]]]]' data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eButure Beta09 8000A Car Jump Starter with 160PSI Air Compressor — Your Ultimate Roadside Emergency Power Pack\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie=\"[\u0026quot;root\u0026quot;,{},[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj21qaprh70anwnwfs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Road emergencies can happen anytime – a dead battery, a flat tire, or a sudden breakdown. Don't get stuck unprepared. With the Buture Beta09 Car Jump Starter 8000A, you have a powerful, portable, all-in-one solution to stay safe and in control on the road. Whether you're commuting, on a long road trip, or exploring the outdoors, the Buture Beta09 ensures you can handle any unexpected situation quickly and confidently.\u0026quot;]]]]\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eRoad emergencies can happen anytime – a dead battery, a flat tire, or a sudden breakdown. Don't get stuck unprepared. With the Buture Beta09 Car Jump Starter 8000A, you have a powerful, portable, all-in-one solution to stay safe and in control on the road. Whether you're commuting, on a long road trip, or exploring the outdoors, the Buture Beta09 ensures you can handle any unexpected situation quickly and confidently.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj27x3z8zpwlbwner6\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Compact \u0026amp; Durable Design for Easy Handling\"]]]]' data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eCompact \u0026amp; Durable Design for Easy Handling\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj27x40069hjgndme9u\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"The Buture Beta09 is thoughtfully designed for portability and convenience. Its compact, lightweight body comes with a hand strap for easy carrying and a large LCD screen to display real-time data. Simple button controls allow anyone to operate it effortlessly.\"]]]]' data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eThe Buture Beta09 is thoughtfully designed for portability and convenience. Its compact, lightweight body comes with a hand strap for easy carrying and a large LED screen to display real-time data. Simple button controls allow anyone to operate it effortlessly.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj27x40yqfkpuia0ql\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"The V0 flame-retardant housing ensures durability under harsh conditions, while an ergonomic reinforced handle reduces weight by 30%, making it easy to use and carry. In emergencies, a built-in side safety hammer enables quick escape by breaking car windows safely, making this jump starter an essential companion for daily driving or long trips.\"]]]]' data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eThe V0 flame-retardant housing ensures durability under harsh conditions, while an ergonomic reinforced handle reduces weight by 30%, making it easy to use and carry. In emergencies, a built-in side safety hammer enables quick escape by breaking car windows safely, making this jump starter an essential companion for daily driving or long trips.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj33kbhfrzva19lb3d\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"All-in-One Car Jump Starter: 4 Essential Functions in One Device\"]]]]' data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eAll-in-One Car Jump Starter: 4 Essential Functions in One Device\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj33ilz71hcy3thjlr\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"1. Jump Starter – 8000 A Peak Current\"]]]]' data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\"\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e1.Car Battery Jump Starter – 8000 A Peak Current\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3jjgzad6vszsgujq\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"With an impressive 8000A peak current, the Buture Beta09 jump starter can reliably start all 12V gasoline engines and up to 12.0L diesel engines, including sedans, SUVs, trucks, and light commercial vehicles.\"]]]]'\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eWith an impressive 8000A peak current, the Buture Beta09 jump starter can reliably start all 12V gasoline engines and up to 12.0L diesel engines, including sedans, SUVs, trucks, and light commercial vehicles.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3jh5vctubjfkisk\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Equipped with smart jumper clamps and extended cables, it provides a safer connection and longer reach when jump starting your vehicle.\"]]]]'\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eEquipped with \u003cstrong\u003esmart jumper clamps\u003c\/strong\u003e and extended cables, it provides a safer connection and longer reach when jump starting your vehicle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3l2jbcugm535ya79\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Ideal for drivers, families, and outdoor enthusiasts who want a reliable, high-performance vehicle battery booster.\"]]]]'\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eIdeal for drivers, families, and outdoor enthusiasts who want a reliable, high-performance vehicle battery booster.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3jh5vj7mu3l1pc2e\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"For extremely drained or low-voltage batteries, the Force Start function allows you to manually activate the booster and revive deeply discharged batteries when a normal jump start may fail.\"]]]]'\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eFor extremely drained or low-voltage batteries, the \u003cstrong\u003eForce Start function \u003c\/strong\u003eallows you to manually activate the booster and revive deeply discharged batteries when a normal jump start may fail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie=\"[\u0026quot;root\u0026quot;,{},[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj3jh5w75tyuqnfgh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;As Buture's current most powerful jump starter, the Beta09 jump starter is perfect for roadside emergencies, daily commuting, and long-distance road trips, giving drivers a reliable and high-performance vehicle battery booster whenever they need it most.\u0026quot;]]]]\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eAs Buture's current \u003cstrong\u003emost powerful jump starter\u003c\/strong\u003e, the Beta09 jump starter is perfect for roadside emergencies, daily commuting, and long-distance road trips, giving drivers a reliable and high-performance vehicle battery booster whenever they need it most.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj33im0x4w0c76fr4o\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Tire Inflator – 160 PSI Smart Air Compressor\"]]]]'\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e2.Tire Inflator – 160 PSI Smart Air Compressor\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie=\"[\u0026quot;root\u0026quot;,{},[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj3n02h06dr78opam8i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Never get stuck with a flat tire! The Buture Beta09 jump starter includes a smart air compressor capable of inflating car tires, bike tires, sports balls, and other inflatables. Key features as below:\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj3n02kz7tcd325yp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Intelligent preset modes with multiple pressure units allow for precise inflation.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj3n02ow26gwz46v18\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Automatic shut-off prevents over-inflation.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj3n02pojty9g8n3to\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Equipped with inflation cable and 3 nozzles, it adapts to every scenario.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj3n02qpw6w5zge34\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;The LCD screen shows real-time pressure readings.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj3n02q2uzjxdsve3h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Perfect for road trips, outdoor adventures, and emergency roadside use, ensuring you're always ready.\u0026quot;]]]]\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eNever get stuck with a flat tire! The Buture Beta09 jump starter includes a smart air compressor capable of inflating car tires, bike tires, sports balls, and other inflatables. Key features as below:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eIntelligent preset modes with multiple pressure units allow for \u003cstrong\u003eprecise inflation\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eAutomatic shut-off prevents over-inflation.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eEquipped with \u003cstrong\u003einflation cable\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e4 nozzles\u003c\/strong\u003e, it adapts to every scenario.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eThe LCD screen shows \u003cstrong\u003ereal-time pressure readings\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003ePerfect for road trips, outdoor adventures, and emergency roadside use, ensuring you're always ready.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj33im06uza3090ow6\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Power Bank – 268000 mAh High-Capacity Battery\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3rl2ayuxlhbyi0uq\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"The Buture Beta09 car jump starter double as a portable power bank, keeping your devices charged during travel or emergencies.  With built-in 26800mAh large-capacity battery cell, equipped with dual output ports, the Buture Beta09 can intelligently identify connected devices and efficiently distribute up to 18W output, providing fast and stable charging for cell phones, cameras, earphones, and other electronic devices to ensure they stay online during your trip.\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3wb2jbptegfyd9it\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Key features as below:\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3tcvh9r1af3ngqdf\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Supports multiple jump starts and over 1000+ charging cycles.\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3uck90s6zfg9sj19\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Two USB outputs (including USB-C) allow fast charging for phones, tablets, cameras, and other electronics.\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3pfr8c16ychow1wl\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Essential for long trips, camping, or unexpected power outages.\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj33im11a2wsav20wy\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Emergency Light – 5 Lighting Modes\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3zhxf5tpovrlqs1c\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"The Buture Beta09 car jump starter is equipped with dual LED lighting on the side, featuring a large high-brightness LED panel and a small spotlight LED bead, designed to handle a wide range of nighttime and emergency scenarios.\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3zhxg4nnzd0b1s84\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"With a long press of the light button, you can quickly switch between five practical lighting modes:\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3zhxgkip8ktdujmi\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Lightning Mode – Bright white light for daily use and repairs\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3zhxgr4ka5wsgz2f\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Orange Warning Mode – Highly visible roadside safety warning\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3zhxgpk2u56lxehd\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Strobe Mode – Flashing signal for attention in emergencies\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3zhxhmjxrc25r5zn\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"SOS Mode – International distress signal for rescue situations\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3zhxhbkejry0ftev\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Long-Range Lamp – Focused spotlight for stable, long-distance illumination\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj3zhxh9xsp6cguxb\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Thanks to its high lumen output, the Buture Beta09 provides clear, wide-area lighting, making it ideal for nighttime vehicle repairs, roadside breakdowns, camping, and outdoor adventures.\"]]]]'\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e3.Power Bank – 268000 mAh High-Capacity Battery\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eThe Buture Beta09 car jump starter double as a portable power bank, keeping your devices charged during travel or emergencies. With built-in 26800mAh large-capacity battery cell, equipped with dual output ports, the Buture Beta09 can intelligently identify connected devices and efficiently distribute up to 18W output, providing fast and stable charging for cell phones, cameras, earphones, and other electronic devices to ensure they stay online during your trip. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eKey features as below:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eSupports multiple jump starts and \u003cstrong\u003eover 1000+\u003c\/strong\u003e charging cycles.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eTwo USB outputs (including USB-C) allow fast charging for phones, tablets, cameras, and other electronics.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eEssential for long trips, camping, or unexpected power outages.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e4.Emergency Light – 5 Lighting Modes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eThe Buture Beta09 car jump starter is equipped with dual LED lighting on the side, featuring a large high-brightness LED panel and a small spotlight LED bead, designed to handle a wide range of nighttime and emergency scenarios.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eWith a long press of the light button, you can quickly switch between five practical lighting modes:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLightning Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bright white light for daily use and repairs\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOrange Warning Mode \u003c\/strong\u003e– Highly visible roadside safety warning\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStrobe Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Flashing signal for attention in emergencies\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSOS Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – International distress signal for rescue situations\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Range Lamp \u003c\/strong\u003e– Focused spotlight for stable, long-distance illumination\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eThanks to its high lumen output, the Buture Beta09 provides clear, wide-area lighting, making it ideal for nighttime vehicle repairs, roadside breakdowns, camping, and outdoor adventures.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie=\"[\u0026quot;root\u0026quot;,{},[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj42rx0wf9s77qd71k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Complete Roadside Emergency Kit for Every Crisis\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj4blv7yhizd8guvt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;The Buture Beta09 car jump starter is also designed as a complete roadside emergency and travel kit, giving drivers the essential tools needed to handle unexpected situations on the road.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj4blv8zulzpzrjh5m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Buture Beta09 roadside power pack includes practical accessories such as tire repair tools, a tow rope, tie-down luggage straps, a 2-in-1 stone hook for removing debris from tires, a safety hammer for emergency window breaking, insulated protective gloves, and more. With these tools, you can quickly deal with common roadside issues like flat tires, towing assistance, securing cargo on the roof, clearing stones from tire treads, or escaping safely from a vehicle in an emergency.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj4blv90kwo5t9b5bid\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Designed for road trips, daily commuting, long-distance driving, camping, and outdoor adventures, the Beta09 ensures you are always prepared for the unexpected.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj4blv9tdguiuq929q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;All accessories are neatly stored in a dedicated storage case, keeping everything organized, portable, and easy to access whenever you need it.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj4blv9o3agyjwwzz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;With the Beta09 All-in-One Roadside Emergency Kit, there's no need to search for multiple tools or carry bulky equipment—everything you need for driving safety, roadside rescue, and travel emergencies is ready in one compact solution.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj4bno7qopp83c6hs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Advanced Safety Protection for Reliable and Secure Use\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj4bns0sgz4ezmw4gl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;The Buture Beta09 car jump starter is designed with comprehensive safety protection to ensure safe and worry-free operation in any situation.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj4magb6ai0kdrkmw8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;10 Smart Protection Functions: Prevents short circuits, overheating, overvoltage, overcharging, deep discharge, overcurrent, and reverse polarity, keeping both you and your vehicle battery safe.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj4magcunyqthufy3j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Durable Construction: V0 flame-retardant housing with internal explosion-proof design withstands harsh conditions and ensures long-lasting reliability.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj4magc5zu5g36ici5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Extreme Temperature Resistant: Operates safely from -4 °F to 140 °F (-20 °C to 60 °C), making it ideal for all-weather use.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mmj4vv8mifjxdq1hejo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Conclusion: Stay ready for anything – the Buture Beta09 is more than a jump starter. With powerful jump-starting, smart air inflation, emergency lighting, and a 16-in-1 emergency kit, it’s your ultimate roadside companion. Travel confidently day or night, and never be left powerless on the road.\u0026quot;]]]]\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eComplete Roadside Emergency Kit for Every Crisis\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eThe Buture Beta09 car jump starter is also designed as a complete roadside emergency and travel kit, giving drivers the essential tools needed to handle unexpected situations on the road.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eButure Beta09 roadside power pack includes practical accessories such as \u003cstrong\u003etire repair tools\u003c\/strong\u003e, a\u003cstrong\u003e tow rope\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003etie-down luggage straps\u003c\/strong\u003e, a \u003cstrong\u003e2-in-1 stone hook \u003c\/strong\u003efor removing debris from tires, a safety hammer for emergency window breaking, insulated protective gloves, and more. With these tools, you can quickly deal with common roadside issues like flat tires, towing assistance, securing cargo on the roof, clearing stones from tire treads, or escaping safely from a vehicle in an emergency.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eDesigned for road trips, daily commuting, long-distance driving, camping, and outdoor adventures, the Beta09 ensures you are always prepared for the unexpected.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eAll accessories are neatly stored in a dedicated storage case, keeping everything organized, portable, and easy to access whenever you need it.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eWith the Beta09 All-in-One Roadside Emergency Kit, there's no need to search for multiple tools or carry bulky equipment—everything you need for driving safety, roadside rescue, and travel emergencies is ready in one compact solution.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eAdvanced Safety Protection for Reliable and Secure Use\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eThe Buture Beta09 car jump starter is designed with comprehensive safety protection to ensure safe and worry-free operation in any situation.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e10 Smart Protection Functions:\u003c\/strong\u003e Prevents short circuits, overheating, overvoltage, overcharging, deep discharge, overcurrent, and reverse polarity, keeping both you and your vehicle battery safe.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDurable Construction: \u003c\/strong\u003eV0 flame-retardant housing with internal explosion-proof design withstands harsh conditions and ensures long-lasting reliability.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtreme Temperature Resistant: \u003c\/strong\u003eOperates safely from -4 °F to 140 °F (-20 °C to 60 °C), making it ideal for all-weather use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj4uufjkd1zwczeib\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Buture Beta09 Specifications Overview\"]]]]'\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eStay ready for anything – the Buture Beta09 is more than a jump starter. With powerful jump-starting, smart air inflation, emergency lighting, and a 16-in-1 emergency kit, it’s your ultimate roadside companion. Travel confidently day or night, and never be left powerless on the road.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eButure Beta09 Specifications Overview\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5jag73WROdG\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"table\",{\"colsWidth\":[325,325],\"uuid\":\"mmj4wjxpnwd6j1pq1g\"},[\"tr\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj4wjxpwp066yz67a\"},[\"tc\",{\"rowSpan\":1,\"colSpan\":1,\"uuid\":\"mmj4wjxokv25to80epa\",\"vAlign\":\"top\"},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj4wjxomnwqqrpffn7\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Parameter\"]]]],[\"tc\",{\"rowSpan\":1,\"colSpan\":1,\"uuid\":\"mmj4wjxov850r450bx\",\"vAlign\":\"top\"},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj4wjxomdc5bfrknng\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Specification\"]]]]],[\"tr\",{\"uuid\":\"mmj4wjxpiyk96xhf2x\"},[\"tc\",{\"rowSpan\":1,\"colSpan\":1,\"uuid\